SUMMARY:Resident Evil (2002)
DESCRIPTION:Classic screening. New Farm Cinemas: Thu 24 September. Join us 
 for a survival-horror video game adaptation double feature. Screening alon
 gside Silent Hill (2006). Based on the popular video game\, Milla Jovovich
  and Michelle Rodriguez star as the leaders of a commando team who must br
 eak into "the hive\," a vast underground genetics laboratory operated by t
 he powerful Umbrella Corporation. There\, a deadly virus has been unleashe
 d\, killing the lab's personnel and resurrecting them as the evil Un-dead.
  The team has just three hours to shut down the lab's supercomputer and cl
 ose the facility before the virus threatens to overrun the Earth.
